msgid ""
"These set-ups are *per* brush engine, so different :ref:"
"`category_brush_engines` can have different configurations."
msgstr ""
"Deze configuratie is *per* penseelengine, zodat verschillende :ref:"
"`category_brush_engines` verschillende configuraties kunnen hebben."

